            "lineHeight": 1.4
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "opening-academic",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 420,
          "content": "I am writing to express my interest in the Full Stack Developer position at Stanford University's Department of Computer Science, as advertised on the university careers portal. With a Bachelor's degree in Software Engineering from NUST and five years of professional experience in web development, I am eager to contribute to your department's research and educational mission.",
          "style": {
            "width": 634,
            "height": 100,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#374151",
            "fontFamily": "Times New Roman, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "academic-body-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 540,
          "content": "My academic background provided a strong foundation in computer science principles, including algorithms, data structures, and software architecture. During my time at NUST, I developed a particular interest in web technologies and human-computer interaction, which led me to pursue a career in full-stack development. I graduated with a 3.8 GPA and was named to the Dean's List for academic excellence.",
          "style": {
            "width": 634,
            "height": 100,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#374151",
            "fontFamily": "Times New Roman, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "academic-body-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 660,
          "content": "In my professional career, I have applied this academic foundation to build scalable web applications using modern technologies including React, Next.js, Node.js, and Python. I have experience with research collaboration, having worked with academic partners to develop tools for data collection and analysis. My work has resulted in several publications in collaboration with research groups.",
          "style": {
            "width": 634,
            "height": 100,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#374151",
            "fontFamily": "Times New Roman, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "academic-body-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 780,
          "content": "I am particularly attracted to Stanford's interdisciplinary approach and the opportunity to work with leading researchers in computer science. I believe my combination of academic training and practical experience would allow me to make meaningful contributions to your department's projects and initiatives.",
          "style": {
            "width": 634,
            "height": 80,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#374151",
            "fontFamily": "Times New Roman, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "closing-academic",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 880,
          "content": "I have attached my curriculum vitae and would welcome the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further. Thank you for your time and consideration.",
          "style": {
            "width": 634,
            "height": 50,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#374151",
            "fontFamily": "Times New Roman, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
